ment parsing errors.</li>  </ul> </div> <div class="refsect1 seealso" id="refsect1-mongodb-bson-binary.getvectortype-seealso">  <h3 class="title">参见</h3>  <ul class="simplelist">   <li><a href="https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/bson-types/" class="link external">»&nbsp;BSON Types</a></li>   <li><span class="enumname"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/enum.mongodb-bson-vectortype.php" class="enumname">MongoDB\BSON\VectorType</a></span></li>  </ul> </div></div>
